"},"$:/plugins/rimir/dashboard/readme":{"title":"$:/plugins/rimir/dashboard/readme","text":"! Dashboard

Turn any tiddler into a //dashboard//: a free-form canvas onto which you drop other tiddlers as freely-arrangeable tiles.

!! What it does

* Tag a tiddler with <<tag "$:/tags/rimir/dashboard">> and its body becomes a canvas.
* **Add tiles** by dragging tiddlers onto the canvas from anywhere in the wiki, or by typing a title and pressing //Add tile//.
* **Move** a tile by dragging its title bar; **resize** it from the bottom-right corner. Positions are saved immediately.
* Each tile transcludes its target tiddler's body.

!! Quick start

# Click //New dashboard// in the page controls (right sidebar → Tools), or tag any tiddler <<tag "$:/tags/rimir/dashboard">>.
# Drag a few tiddlers onto the canvas.
# Rearrange them however you like.

!! How it is stored

Each tile is its own small tiddler tagged <<tag "$:/tags/rimir/dashboard/tile">> with a `dashboard` field (the parent dashboard) and `target` / `x` / `y` / `w` / `h` fields. No JSON blobs — deleting a dashboard's tiles is just deleting those tiddlers.

!! Prerequisites

TiddlyWiki >= 5.4.0. No other plugin dependencies.
"},"$:/plugins/rimir/dashboard/settings":{"title":"$:/plugins/rimir/dashboard/settings","text":"! Dashboard settings

This plugin is convention-driven; there are no global settings yet.

!! Marking a dashboard

Tag a tiddler with <<tag "$:/tags/rimir/dashboard">>. A view-template body cascade entry (`$:/config/ViewTemplateBodyFilters/rimir-dashboard`, ordered before `default`) swaps its body to the dashboard canvas.

!! Tile tiddlers

Tiles are tiddlers tagged <<tag "$:/tags/rimir/dashboard/tile">> with these fields:

|!Field |!Meaning |
|`dashboard` |Title of the dashboard this tile belongs to |
|`target` |Title of the tiddler shown inside the tile |
|`x` / `y` |Top-left position in pixels, relative to the canvas |
|`w` / `h` |Width / height in pixels |

Geometry is written by a small `<$dashboard-drag>` widget on pointer release via a plain `$action-setfield` — the values are ordinary editable fields.
"},"$:/plugins/rimir/dashboard/styles":{"title":"$:/plugins/rimir/dashboard/styles","tags":"$:/tags/Stylesheet","text":"\rules except dash

.rr-dash-root {
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: column;
}

/* Core's ViewTemplate body transcludes in inline mode, wrapping our root in a
   <p>. Collapse that wrapper so it contributes no stray margins (see the
   flibbles/graph <p>-cascade fix). */
.tc-tiddler-body > p:has(> .rr-dash-root) {
	display: contents;
}

.rr-dash-toolbar {
	display: flex;
	gap: .5em;
	align-items: center;
	flex-wrap: wrap;
	margin-bottom: .5em;
}

.rr-dash-add-input {
	flex: 1 1 12em;
	min-width: 8em;
}

.rr-dash-hint {
	color: rgba(128,128,128,0.9);
	font-style: italic;
	padding: 1em;
}

.rr-dash-canvas {
	position: relative;
	min-height: 70vh;
	overflow: auto;
	border: 1px solid rgba(128,128,128,0.35);
	border-radius: 6px;
	background-color: <<colour tiddler-background>>;
	background-image:
		linear-gradient(rgba(128,128,128,0.10) 1px, transparent 1px),
		linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(128,128,128,0.10) 1px, transparent 1px);
	background-size: 24px 24px;
}

.rr-dash-canvas.tc-dragover {
	outline: 2px dashed rgba(80,140,220,0.8);
	outline-offset: -4px;
}

.rr-dash-box {
	display: flex;
	flex-direction: column;
	background-color: <<colour tiddler-background>>;
	border: 1px solid rgba(128,128,128,0.35);
	border-radius: 6px;
	box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
	overflow: hidden;
}

.rr-dash-box.rr-dash-dragging {
	box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.30);
	opacity: .96;
}

.rr-dash-handle {
	display: flex;
	align-items: center;
	justify-content: space-between;
	gap: .5em;
	padding: 2px 4px 2px 8px;
	cursor: move;
	background-color: rgba(128,128,128,0.14);
	border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(128,128,128,0.30);
	user-select: none;
	touch-action: none;
	font-size: .8em;
}

.rr-dash-title {
	overflow: hidden;
	text-overflow: ellipsis;
	white-space: nowrap;
	font-weight: 600;
}

.rr-dash-controls {
	display: flex;
	gap: 1px;
	align-items: center;
	flex: 0 0 auto;
}

.rr-dash-ctl {
	border: none;
	background: transparent;
	cursor: pointer;
	color: inherit;
	opacity: .55;
	padding: 0 4px;
	line-height: 1;
	font-size: 1.05em;
}

.rr-dash-ctl:hover {
	opacity: 1;
}

.rr-dash-body {
	flex: 1;
	overflow: auto;
	padding: 4px 10px;
}

/* Bare tiles: no header, the whole box is the move/open surface, content is a
   non-interactive preview. Controls float in the corner and appear on hover. */
.rr-dash-bare {
	cursor: grab;
}

.rr-dash-bare.rr-dash-dragging {
	cursor: grabbing;
}

.rr-dash-bare > .rr-dash-body {
	pointer-events: none;
	height: 100%;
}

.rr-dash-bare > .rr-dash-controls {
	position: absolute;
	top: 2px;
	right: 2px;
	z-index: 2;
	background: rgba(128,128,128,0.20);
	border-radius: 4px;
	opacity: 0;
	transition: opacity .1s ease;
}

.rr-dash-bare:hover > .rr-dash-controls {
	opacity: 1;
}

.rr-dash-resize {
	position: absolute;
	right: 0;
	bottom: 0;
	width: 16px;
	height: 16px;
	cursor: se-resize;
	user-select: none;
	touch-action: none;
	background: linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 50%, rgba(128,128,128,0.55) 50%);
}
